# Render with: vhs demo/infected.tape
Output demo/infected.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1240
Set Height 440
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Hide
Type "source demo/demo.sh && export PS1='$ ' && clear" Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Type "npm install @demo/colors" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "thymus" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 7s
